{"3063210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "仙灵正传", "steam_appid": 3063210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063210/extras/bdcd45ae3f329a4f2199fe320bf5a7b4.poster.avif?t=1729454406\" width=800 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063210/extras/bdcd45ae3f329a4f2199fe320bf5a7b4.webm?t=1729454406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063210/extras/bdcd45ae3f329a4f2199fe320bf5a7b4.mp4?t=1729454406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >关注我们了解《仙灵正传》的最新情报</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【游戏特色】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★唯美江湖 纯正仙侠</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玄幻的修仙世界，恢弘的地图场景，诛仙塔、九幽魔窟、蛮荒大陆、洪荒岛、万古仙殿、鸿蒙古殿、神兽岛、太极古境、星辰暗殿、帝尊神域，层层深入的唯美古境，令人沉浸其中!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★全新地图 无限BOSS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >神装随机掉落，抢夺BOSS归属，将神装据为已有！无限战斗乐趣，无限难度副本考验真正的技术!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★逆天改命 突破极限</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >觉醒之日，称霸之时，屠魔戮仙，神帝至尊，帝域修炼，圣化触顶复见新天。群仙乱斗，神威现世，万物归烬。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★帮派社交 跨服PK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >帮派聚义，跨服称霸做大佬。组建仙盟，守卫帮派，全帮成员同心御外敌，挚友开黑，史诗副本不在话下。强强对决，打造全服超强帮派，是时候表演真正的技术了。</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063210/extras/bdcd45ae3f329a4f2199fe320bf5a7b4.poster.avif?t=1729454406\" width=800 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063210/extras/bdcd45ae3f329a4f2199fe320bf5a7b4.webm?t=1729454406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063210/extras/bdcd45ae3f329a4f2199fe320bf5a7b4.mp4?t=1729454406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >关注我们了解《仙灵正传》的最新情报</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【游戏特色】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★唯美江湖 纯正仙侠</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玄幻的修仙世界，恢弘的地图场景，诛仙塔、九幽魔窟、蛮荒大陆、洪荒岛、万古仙殿、鸿蒙古殿、神兽岛、太极古境、星辰暗殿、帝尊神域，层层深入的唯美古境，令人沉浸其中!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★全新地图 无限BOSS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >神装随机掉落，抢夺BOSS归属，将神装据为已有！无限战斗乐趣，无限难度副本考验真正的技术!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★逆天改命 突破极限</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >觉醒之日，称霸之时，屠魔戮仙，神帝至尊，帝域修炼，圣化触顶复见新天。群仙乱斗，神威现世，万物归烬。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★帮派社交 跨服PK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >帮派聚义，跨服称霸做大佬。组建仙盟，守卫帮派，全帮成员同心御外敌，挚友开黑，史诗副本不在话下。强强对决，打造全服超强帮派，是时候表演真正的技术了。</p>", "short_description": "《仙灵正传》是一款以中国上古洪荒神话为题材的放置角色扮演游戏，游戏具有独特的功能和精美的画面。玩家不仅可以在游戏中修仙，还可以结识仙侣，驯服神兽坐骑，全新的地图和装备，让你体验修仙。玩家在游戏中化身修真者，穿梭于修仙界，不断提升实力，在战斗中成长，用神器武装自己，一步步走向修仙界的巅峰。多种多样的酷炫时装，神奇百变的天神坐骑，最原汁原味的仙侠世界等你一起来体验！", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063210/header.jpg?t=1729454406", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063210/6b01e076c190199a0d0f9904fe1c17e7b177eaeb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729454406", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063210/6b01e076c190199a0d0f9904fe1c17e7b177eaeb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1729454406", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10/11<br></li><li><strong>Process